# Revenue Analysis — MANDATORY for Every Solicitation

**When ANY solicitation is analyzed (RFP, ITB, RFQ, RFI, Sources Sought, Presolicitation), ALWAYS generate a REVENUE ANALYSIS section. No exceptions.**

---

## The Rule

Before recommending GO or NO-GO on any opportunity, calculate and present the full revenue picture. Dee needs to see the money before committing time and resources.

---

